ha"},{"position":13,"text":"هُوَ","translation":"He","transliteration":"huwa"},{"position":14,"text":"مَوْلَىٰهُ","translation":"(is) his Protector","transliteration":"mawlāhu"},{"position":15,"text":"وَجِبْرِيلُ","translation":"and Jibreel","transliteration":"wajib'rīlu"},{"position":16,"text":"وَصَـٰلِحُ","translation":"and (the) righteous","transliteration":"waṣāliḥu"},{"position":17,"text":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ","translation":"believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna"},{"position":18,"text":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","translation":"and the Angels","transliteration":"wal-malāikatu"},{"position":19,"text":"بَعْدَ","translation":"after","transliteration":"baʿda"},{"position":20,"text":"ذَٰلِكَ","translation":"that","transliteration":"dhālika"},{"position":21,"text":"ظَهِيرٌ","translation":"(are his) assistants","transliteration":"ẓahīrun"}]},{"id":5234,"verseKey":"66:5","verseNumber":5,"arabic":"عَسَىٰ رَبُّهُۥٓ إِن طَلَّقَكُنَّ أَن يُبْدِلَهُۥٓ أَزْوَٰجًا خَيْرًا مِّنكُنَّ مُسْلِمَـٰتٍ مُّؤْمِنَـٰتٍ قَـٰنِتَـٰتٍ تَـٰٓئِبَـٰتٍ عَـٰبِدَٰتٍ سَـٰٓئِحَـٰتٍ ثَيِّبَـٰتٍ وَأَبْكَارًا","translation":"Perhaps his Lord, if he divorced you [all], would substitute for him wives better than you - submitting [to Allāh], believing, devoutly obedient, repentant, worshipping, and traveling - [ones] previously married and virgins.","transliteration":"ʿasā rabbuhu in ṭallaqakunna an yub'dilahu azwājan khayran minkunna mus'limātin mu'minātin qānitātin tāibātin ʿābidātin sāiḥātin thayyibātin wa-abkāran","audioUrl":"/audio/7/066005.mp3","segments":[[0,1,110,770],[1,2,780,3230],[2,3,3240,3580],[3,4,3590,6410],[4,5,6420,7430],[5,6,7440,9680],[6,7,9690,10790],[7,8,10800,11480],[8,9,11490,14530],[9,10,14540,19740],[10,11,19750,22040],[11,12,22050,24320],[12,13,24330,27240],[13,14,27250,29530],[14,15,29540,33270],[15,16,33280,35380],[16,17,35390,36980]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"عَسَىٰ","translation":"Perhaps","transliteration":"ʿasā"},{"position":2,"text":"رَبُّهُۥٓ","translation":"his Lord","t